<div class="thesis">
  <p class="reveal lead">You don't need another screen.</p>
  <p class="reveal">
    Fountain is a small, considered object. You wear one version on your body.
    You set the other on a desk. Together they form an ambient AI — projecting
    useful intelligence into the world where you actually live, instead of
    pulling you back into a phone.
  </p>
  <p class="reveal">
    A turn arrow on your handlebars when you're somewhere new. The freshness
    of an avocado, on the avocado. A doorbell on a door without one. A meeting
    on the table you're already sitting at.
  </p>
  <p class="reveal closer">
    The screen looks back at you.<br>Fountain looks with you.
  </p>
</div>

